-- Voysae
-- ============================================================
--  RARE EGG KG NOTIFIER + CONFIGURABLE RARITY SERVER HOPPER  (v5.3, scramble tracker + halloween site push)
--  Standalone, made for auto execute.
--  1) Watches the field only for the rarities selected in HOP_FOR and
--     posts a Discord embed with the egg's kg, mutation and money/s.
--  2) Runs forever. It waits in the server until a selected egg
--     appears. When one is found it sends the webhook and starts a
--     5 minute window (eggs refresh every 5 minutes). During the
--     window it hops servers, alerting on any selected egg it finds.
--     When the window ends it stops hopping, stays in the current
--     server and waits for the next selected egg, then repeats.
--  3) TEST BUTTONS in the middle of the screen.
--  4) SCRAMBLE TRACKER (new in v5.2):
--     - When the Dr. Scramble boss event is running in the server, it posts
--       ONE message (join link + phase + boss HP) and edits that same message
--       every 10 seconds while the boss is alive.
--     - Boss dies (Phase = Defeated): the message is edited to "Boss Dead."
--     - If a rare egg makes the script hop away: the message is edited right
--       before the teleport to say "Not in server anymore".
--     - Every edit refreshes a "Last updated" time, so a message that stopped
--       updating (account closed or crashed) shows how stale it is.
--     - Scramble NEVER starts hopping by itself. Only a listed rare egg does.
--  5) HALLOWEEN -> LIVE SPAWN PAGE (new in v5.3):
--     - Rare Halloween Dimension eggs are also sent to the Worker (/push and
--       /alert) so they show up on the Live Spawn page. Switch: HALLOWEEN_SITE.
--  Stop hopping by hand: run   getgenv().EGGKG_STOP = true
-- ============================================================

